QBdi2Q3tOgoXZk4DyeeoXYwR7e7nZwstXTMoPbXQApLyTE2nQNpo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGXOZH5zKsp_r8ernt4cPLiZtKzFF1d3z3FzfS1kVL3-Q&oe=6A8EBBCE"}, {"file_name": "Code_Playground_View_Pond.png", "id": "1593305657751911", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974576_1593305661085244_1368760051307669731_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VXz8s1mVhEwQ7kNvwE3CpEM&_nc_oc=AdrNVHKCjv3idOsnz6whTDPskaYW5Z3gFRxbh0zO9nm2POz--ltzZX7rqne5w1RZ9Jk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHp6DCvyeE4aoKa2wwCFGdrS3flFtSrYDnnKjczwgD4zg&oe=6A8EEE21"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "PVR_Cover Landscape - 2560x1440.png", "id": "429997232540328", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75361360_429997235873661_5804819608709080672_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b8ET7Z_F_20Q7kNvwFR8WRW&_nc_oc=Adpdx5VCTkX3r3_fdU6lK0cJinSdBhNmA_W-fxCtREadnIDSS1qZmHZsMtCMwZX3uz4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFXoArICgm5URs6Y49dTSQV6RH32hYy3Y-HiSl92-vq_g&oe=6A8EC148"}, "display_name": "Programmer VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Want to learn programming in a fun way? \n\nLook no further than Programmer VR\n\nHelp Bob collect rewards by overcoming obstacles in 3 breathtaking virtual worlds.  Learn programming concepts, sharpen your logical thinking and develop problem-solving skills in an easy, fun, immersive, and enjoyable way. This game is brought to you by the developers of iB Cricket, one of the highest-rated VR games.\n\nKey features:\n- 50 levels of programming fun\n- 3 enchanting virtual worlds -  Pond, Futuristic Neon City, and Neon Pyramid\n- No previous programming knowledge is required\n- Sharpen your logical thinking skills and improve your critical thinking skills\n- Learn programming concepts like Instruction execution order,  Conditional Statements, and Loops.\n- Co-op Mode\n", "sh